+
+<!-- task body. `wingfoil memory add` copies this scaffold, setting only `id`, `title` and
+     `status` (and any `--tags` or `--set` value). Fill the required frontmatter fields and replace
+     these placeholder comments yourself; `wingfoil memory submit` then checks the required fields,
+     moves `status` forward and commits the document as you left it, naming in the commit body the
+     content it carries. -->
+
+`cancel(bookingId, at)` cancels a booking at the ISO-8601 UTC instant `at` and returns
+`{ bookingId, refund }` (euro cents). A cancelled booking no longer holds its equipment (clash checks
+and availability ignore it). A booking can be cancelled only once; an unknown booking id, an invalid
+`at`, or a second cancellation throws.
+
+Refund policy (the request does not state one; assumption to confirm): cancelling before the booking
+starts refunds its full total; from the start on, nothing is refunded; at or after the end the booking
+can no longer be cancelled (throws).
